  "finding": "Both attempts reproduced the same strict tap-duration failure. Real MotionEvent timestamps measured 403 ms and 418 ms against the unchanged <400 ms guard. Event creation through DOWN injection return consumed 319 ms and 304 ms before the test unconditionally added its nominal 80 ms sleep.",
